Package: wintaskmanager
Version: @VERSION@
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Maintainer: ketchupboy <epiklal522@gmail.com>
Depends: python3 (>= 3.10), python3-venv, python3-pip, libegl1, libgl1, libxkbcommon0, libfontconfig1, libdbus-1-3, libxcb-cursor0
Recommends: smartmontools, lm-sensors, dmidecode, pciutils
Suggests: sysbench, fio, glmark2
Description: Linux task manager in the style of Windows 10/11
 Processes, performance graphs (CPU, RAM, disks, network, GPU), sensors,
 services, Docker containers, autostart entries and benchmarks.
 Can also run headless as a monitoring server for remote clients.
 .
 PySide6 and psutil are installed from PyPI into /opt/wintaskmanager/venv
 during installation, so the installation needs internet access.
